This repository is an unofficial fork of
https://github.com/google-research/harness2

Modifications in this fork, made in 2026 and not reviewed by the upstream
authors, are:

  - the `pi` and `dsh` solver substrates under harness2/substrate/, the shared
    agent-CLI plumbing and the rollout runner they use;
  - the `custom` benchmark, the built-in custom seed, and harness2-export;
  - the `pi` improver channel and its prompt surfaces;
  - changes to the configuration, CLI, preflight, setup, prompts, proposer and
    recursion modules, and to the JobBench adapter and its judge patch, needed
    to select, validate and run those additions.

Files carrying a Google copyright header that this fork changed also carry a
one-line notice under that header. Everything else is upstream work.

